{"type":"after","callId":"call@68","endTime":34912.329,"result":{"matches":true,"received":{"value":{"s":"58"},"ariaSnapshot":"- banner:\n  - text: EvoLab / field expedition 01\n  - heading \"Living Island\" [level=1]\n  - paragraph: Small creatures. Changing worlds. An evolutionary story you can follow.\n  - button \"← All EvoLab activities\"\n  - button \"Field journal ↗\"\n- navigation \"Explore the expedition\":\n  - button \"Your first discovery\"\n  - button \"Choose a question\"\n  - button \"Two futures\"\n  - button \"Evidence\"\n  - button \"Family journey\"\n- region \"Your first discovery\":\n  - text: Your first discovery · 3/3\n  - heading \"You have a family story to investigate.\" [level=2]\n  - paragraph: Open the family journey to see who inherited this ancestry. Revisit any recorded generation to meet its relatives.\n  - text: \"Sage · #1 · G0\"\n  - button \"Read the family story\"\n  - button \"Explore freely\"\n- button \"▶ Play evolution\"\n- button \"Next generation →\"\n- text: Time travel\n- slider \"Time travel\": \"1\"\n- text: 1 / 1 Pace\n- combobox \"Pace\":\n  - option \"1×\" [selected]\n  - option \"2×\"\n  - option \"4×\"\n- status: 25 / 36 survived to breed. Their offspring form the new generation. Parents keep their original traits.\n- main \"Island and generation report\":\n  - region \"Habitat and generation controls\":\n    - strong: ☀ Sunlit meadow\n    - text: World seed 2026\n    - strong: Generation 1\n    - text: Present day\n    - group \"Living Island habitat. Use the organism selector below to inspect any creature.\"\n    - group \"Island camera\":\n      - button \"Rotate left\": ↶\n      - button \"Rotate right\": ↷\n      - button \"Zoom in\": +\n      - button \"Zoom out\": −\n      - button \"Reset camera\": ⌂\n    - text: \"Pip · #58\"\n    - button \"Creature close-up\"\n    - strong: A volcanic field island\n    - text: Galápagos-inspired · fictional research habitat\n    - group \"Scenic viewpoints\":\n      - button \"Island\"\n      - button \"Lava coast\"\n      - button \"Highlands\"\n    - text: Drag to orbit · tap a creature to meet it · pale rings mark your selection, gold rings its family\n    - region \"Field lenses\":\n      - heading \"Field lenses\" [level=2]\n      - text: See the variation hiding in plain sight. View\n      - combobox \"View\":\n        - option \"Natural appearance\" [selected]\n        - option \"Coat lightness\"\n        - option \"Insulation\"\n        - option \"Leg length\"\n      - paragraph: Choose a trait to reveal measurement bars above the spriglets. Inspect two contrasting residents, then follow that variation through a generation.\n    - group \"Replay a recorded generation\":\n      - button \"Show parents\":\n        - text: 1 · Parents\n        - strong: \"36\"\n      - button \"Show survivors\":\n        - text: 2 · Survivors\n        - strong: \"25\"\n      - button \"Show offspring\" [pressed]:\n        - text: 3 · Offspring\n        - strong: \"60\"\n    - strong: Recorded generation 1\n    - button \"Watch generation story\"\n  - region \"Generation field report\":\n    - text: A closer look at what happened\n    - heading \"Generation field report\" [level=2]\n    - text: G0 → G1\n    - paragraph: \"Recorded habitat: Sunlit meadow\"\n    - strong: \"36\"\n    - text: Parents\n    - strong: \"25\"\n    - text: Survivors\n    - strong: \"60\"\n    - text: Offspring Largest mean shift\n    - strong: Insulation\n    - paragraph: 51.8 → 45.2 · rounded means · 0–100 scale\n    - text: \"-6.5 points\"\n    - button \"Investigate this shift\"\n    - paragraph: A mean can shift through survival differences, inheritance and chance. One generation alone does not establish adaptation.\n    - text: New variation to investigate\n    - strong: \"Tavi · #68\"\n    - text: 3 recorded allele mutations · not a guaranteed advantage\n    - button \"Meet this offspring\"\n    - paragraph: \"18 new allele mutations in this cohort · Trait diversity (mean SD): 19.7/100\"\n- complementary \"Expedition field desk\":\n  - text: Expedition field desk Choose one thing to explore\n  - tablist \"Field desk views\":\n    - tab \"Explore\"\n    - tab \"Families\" [selected]\n    - tab \"Investigate\"\n    - tab \"Evidence\"\n  - tabpanel \"Families\":\n    - region \"Family journey\":\n      - text: One ancestor. Many possible futures.\n      - heading \"Family journey\" [level=2]\n      - text: \"Sage · #1 · Ancestor born in G0\"\n      - button \"Revisit the ancestor\"\n      - group \"Recorded family generations\":\n        - button \"Visit family in generation 0 · 1 family members\":\n          - text: G0\n          - strong: \"1\"\n          - text: 2.8%\n        - button \"Visit family in generation 1 · 3 family members\" [pressed]:\n          - text: G1\n          - strong: \"3\"\n          - text: 5.0%\n      - button \"Previous family generation\": ←\n      - button \"Next family generation\" [disabled]: →\n      - text: Family members · share of this generation\n      - button \"Meet another family member\"\n      - strong: G1 · 3 / 60 residents belong to this family\n      - paragraph: These are new individuals with a shared ancestor. They also inherit from their other parent; sharing ancestry does not mean keeping the ancestor’s exact traits.\n      - text: Meet a descendant in this generation\n      - strong: \"Pip · #58\"\n      - text: Insulation 28/100 · Born in generation 1\n      - button \"Find on the island\"\n      - region \"Family time machine\":\n        - text: Follow the family, not a fixed trait\n        - heading \"Family time machine\" [level=3]\n        - paragraph: Travel through recorded generations. The island follows your cursor; no new survival or inheritance is rolled.\n        - text: Trait to follow\n        - combobox \"Trait to follow\":\n          - option \"Coat lightness\"\n          - option \"Insulation\" [selected]\n          - option \"Leg length\"\n        - text: Family mean Whole-population mean Family range\n        - img \"Family trait mean and full range compared with the whole population. Values use a 0–100 scale. Exact data are in the complete family record.\": 0 50 100 G0 G1\n        - text: Travel through family history · G1\n        - slider \"Travel through family history · G1\": \"1\"\n        - paragraph: \"Recorded habitat: Sunlit meadow\"\n        - text: Vertical dotted lines mark recorded habitat changes, not proof of their effects. Ancestor’s trait\n        - strong: \"35.1\"\n        - text: \"#1 · G0 Family mean\"\n        - strong: \"52.2\"\n        - text: 3 family members Whole-population mean\n        - strong: \"45.2\"\n        - text: 60 residents, including this family\n        - paragraph: \"Family mean change since the ancestor: +17.1 points on the 0–100 trait scale. These are different individuals, not an ancestor changing during its lifetime.\"\n        - text: Lowest in this family\n        - strong: 27.6/100\n        - text: \"Pip · #58\"\n        - button \"Meet lowest-trait member\"\n        - text: Highest in this family\n        - strong: 74.3/100\n        - text: \"Nori · #43\"\n        - button \"Meet highest-trait member\"\n        - paragraph: The shaded band spans the lowest to highest actual family values. It is not a confidence interval. Higher values are not automatically better; descendants also inherit from their other parent.\n        - button \"Save family trait evidence\"\n      - group: Read the complete family record\n    - region \"Family connections\":\n      - text: A life in the lineage\n      - heading \"Family connections\" [level=2]\n      - text: \"Spriglet #58 Parents\"\n      - 'button \"Meet parent #1\"':\n        - strong: Sage\n        - text: \"#1 · G0\"\n      - 'button \"Meet parent #16\"':\n        - strong: Moss\n        - text: \"#16 · G0\"\n      - strong: Pip\n      - text: \"#58 · G1 0 direct offspring\"\n      - paragraph: This organism’s next generation has not been recorded yet.\n      - region \"How this offspring inherited its traits\":\n        - text: Inside a birth\n        - heading \"How this offspring inherited its traits\" [level=3]\n        - text: \"Pip · #58 · G1 Trait to trace\"\n        - combobox \"Trait to trace\":\n          - option \"Coat lightness\"\n          - option \"Insulation\" [selected]\n          - option \"Leg length\"\n        - status:\n          - strong: 1 / 4 · Two parents, two copies each\n          - paragraph: Each parent has two alleles for this trait. An allele is a version of a gene.\n        - strong: Sage\n        - text: \"Parent 1 · #1 Copy 1 3.85 Copy 2 66.30\"\n        - strong: Moss\n        - text: \"Parent 2 · #16 Copy 1 51.43 Copy 2 23.64\"\n        - paragraph: Values use a 0–100 teaching scale and are rounded. Higher is not always better.\n        - button \"Next inheritance step\"\n        - button \"Watch inheritance\"\n        - button \"Start reveal again\"\n      - group: Trace each inherited allele\n- group: How this world works · teacher notes\n- text: 📝 My field note\n- paragraph: What changed in your population? Use a before-and-after number, explain inheritance and survival, and name one limit of this model.\n- button \"Read this aloud\": 🔊\n- group \"Note shape\":\n  - button \"Free note\" [pressed]\n  - button \"Claim · Evidence · Reasoning\"\n- textbox \"📝 My field note\":\n  - /placeholder: Write one or two sentences in your own words…\n- text: 0 / 2000\n- status\n- button \"Save note\" [disabled]"}},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@68"}
